# Entries of this seed re-copied into /agent-data on EVERY boot (image
# authoritative; a directory is replaced whole), so a rebuilt image's updated
# docs and skills reach an existing sandbox. Everything else is seeded once on
# first boot and then left to the runtime (settings.json, .claude.json,
# plugins/, COLLABORATOR.md, the saved login). One top-level name per line.
# Read by the sealed /usr/local/lib/cove/seed-agent-data.sh.
CLAUDE.md
PROGRESSIVE_DISCLOSURE.md
SANDBOX.md
reference
skills
